{"id":"85e306b51d3267ec","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-fixed-point.md","title":"Fixed Point","display":"df-fixed-point — Fixed Point","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-fixed-point","aliases":["89-df-fixed-point"],"display":"df-fixed-point — Fixed Point","depends_on":["[[89-df-modal-formula]]","[[89-df-substitution-modal]]","[[89-df-modal-equivalence]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-fixed-point"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-fixed-point</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-fixed-point — Fixed Point"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" href=\"?note=56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" title=\"89-df-modal-formula\">89-df-modal-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"48f7a8aeae4eecb4\" href=\"?note=48f7a8aeae4eecb4\" title=\"89-df-substitution-modal\">89-df-substitution-modal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2112b0932fb2c41d\" href=\"?note=2112b0932fb2c41d\" title=\"89-df-modal-equivalence\">89-df-modal-equivalence</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(L\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span> is a modal logic.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\">\\(p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A[p:=B]\">\\(A[p:=B]\\)</span> is modal substitution (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"48f7a8aeae4eecb4\" href=\"?note=48f7a8aeae4eecb4\" title=\"89-df-substitution-modal\">89-df-substitution-modal</a>).</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Fix}_{L}(A,p,B)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\left(\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\ \\land\\\\\n&amp;\\forall C,D\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;\nB[p:=C]=B[p:=D]\\ \\land\\\\\n&amp;\\bigl(B\\leftrightarrow A[p:=B]\\bigr)\\in L\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Fix}_{L}(A,p,B)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\left(\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\ \\land\\\\\n&amp;\\forall C,D\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;\nB[p:=C]=B[p:=D]\\ \\land\\\\\n&amp;\\bigl(B\\leftrightarrow A[p:=B]\\bigr)\\in L\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>第二行用替换不变性精确定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 不含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span>；模态命题语法没有变量绑定，\n因而它等价于通常的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\notin\\operatorname{Var}(B)\">\\(p\\notin\\operatorname{Var}(B)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>最后一行是在逻辑 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 中可证的句法等价，不是元层公式相等。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-modal-formula","status":"resolved","id":"56c1b5b75a32ca1d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-substitution-modal","status":"resolved","id":"48f7a8aeae4eecb4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-substitution-modal]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-equivalence","status":"resolved","id":"2112b0932fb2c41d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-equivalence]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-substitution-modal","status":"resolved","id":"48f7a8aeae4eecb4","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A[p:=B]$ is modal substitution (see [[89-df-substitution-modal]]).","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"L\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"A[p:=B]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Fix}_{L}(A,p,B)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\left(\n\\begin{aligned}\n&B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\ \\land\\\\\n&\\forall C,D\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;\nB[p:=C]=B[p:=D]\\ \\land\\\\\n&\\bigl(B\\leftrightarrow A[p:=B]\\bigr)\\in L\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"p\\notin\\operatorname{Var}(B)","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false}],"bytes":1072,"backlinks":[{"id":"02536e2efd437c59","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Fix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A,p,B)$ is the fixed-point predicate (see [[89-df-fixed-point]])."},{"id":"05a599f85e508061","anchor":"ref-30","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-fixed-point]]"},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-21","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-4-axiom.md]]\n[[89-df-accessibility.md]]\n[[89-df-arithmetical-interpretation.md]]\n[[89-df-arithmetical-realization.md]]\n[[89-df-bisimulation.md]]\n[[89-df-box-modality.md]]\n[[89-df-canonical-model.md]]\n[[89-df-completeness-modal.md]]\n[[89-df-consistency-modal.md]]\n[[89-df-consistency-statement.md]]\n[[89-df-consistent-pa.md]]\n[[89-df-converse-well-founded.md]]\n[[89-df-dejongh-theorem.md]]